<title>USA: MAPCO Inc Q1 March 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>MAPCO Inc Q1 March 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr		    $1.32		    $0.95</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.60		    $0.59</p>
<p> Net income		72,700		   55,200</p>
<p> Revs		     931,200		  741,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  55,200		   58,100</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 includes $39.9 million or $0.72 per share after-tax gain on the sale of natural gas liquids and condensate reserves in the West Panhandle Fields of Texas.  </p>
<p>1996 Q1 includes $13.1 million or $0.23 per share after-tax gain on the sale of Iowa retail propane assets and fertilizer assets and earnings of $0.13 per share or $7.8 million, from discontinued coal operations.</p>
</text>
